# Pollution object counter (CPU footprint count, PollutionCount.cpp TARGET_PC), bianco/0: spray the footprint of object O1
# (joint bounds x 1422..3066, z 5062..5605, [hplog-objreg]) on a teleport grid: rows facing +z, then from the north facing -z,
# then from the south facing +z. Expect [hplog-obj] O1 deg below 30 (map 2) -> cleaned=1 -> [hplog-event] sink building 1 rises.
# Env: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=bianco/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_HPLOG=1. About 280 s on WARP (route.py --seconds 320).
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=60
cheat infinite_health
cheat infinite_water
log
tp x=1450 y=2600 z=4900 yaw=0
wait frames=12
hold trig=0,255 frames=60
